{#- Base template for every `tell backtest` report (spec section 13 "Reporting rules").
    Renders, in order: front matter, question, cohort and N, notices, the numbers, the query
    or script, the caveats and the date. `r` is a tell.backtest.common.Report. Square brackets
    never appear in the output (tell.backtest.common.render_report replaces them). -#}
---
report: {{ r.name }}
title: "{{ r.title }}"
as_of: {{ r.as_of.isoformat() }}
generated_at: {{ r.generated_iso }}
n: {{ r.n }}
quotable: {{ "true" if r.quotable else "false" }}
flagged_numbers: {{ r.flagged }}
script: {{ r.script }}
private: {{ "true" if r.private else "false" }}
---

# {{ r.title }}

{% block intro %}
Dated report written by `tell backtest {{ r.name }}`. Numbers are quoted from this file only, with their N; a number with N under 30 is marked "too small to quote".
{% endblock %}

{% if not r.quotable %}
**Not quotable:** {{ r.not_quotable_reasons | join("; ") }}.
{% endif %}

## Question

{{ r.question }}

## Cohort

{{ r.cohort }}

Cohort N: {{ r.n }}.

{% for line in r.notices %}
**{{ line }}**

{% endfor %}
## Numbers

{% for section in r.sections %}
### {{ section.title }}

{% if section.text %}
{{ section.text }}

{% endif %}
{% for m in section.metrics %}
- {{ m.label }}: {{ m.rendered }}
{% endfor %}
{% if section.metrics %}

{% endif %}
{% if section.table %}
{{ section.table.markdown }}

{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
## Query or script

Script: `{{ r.script }}`.

{% for q in r.queries %}
{{ q.title }}:

```{{ q.language }}
{{ q.sql }}
```

{% endfor %}
## Caveats

{% for c in r.caveats %}
- {{ c }}
{% endfor %}

## Date

As of {{ r.as_of.isoformat() }}; generated {{ r.generated_iso }}.
{% block footer %}{% endblock %}
